{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43788460",
      "title": "Understanding Components & How Content Ends Up On The Screen",
      "lectureOrder": 12,
      "videoOrder": 10,
      "sourceHash": "dd7a5944cb4fc71ee569d1b05aea4dec71fac4253d0225ee76f4b72c4abcd9db",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 1.8,
          "en": "So how does this content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.8,
          "end": 3.393,
          "en": "end up on our screen?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.29,
          "end": 7.32,
          "en": "Well, I mentioned in the previous lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.32,
          "end": 11.88,
          "en": "that it would be that index HTML file in the src folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.88,
          "end": 14.85,
          "en": "that would in the end be loaded by the browser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.85,
          "end": 18.18,
          "en": "when visitors visit our website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.18,
          "end": 19.95,
          "en": "But if you take a closer look at that file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.95,
          "end": 22.62,
          "en": "you will see that it's almost empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.62,
          "end": 27.62,
          "en": "The body element there only contains one HTML element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.02,
          "end": 30.57,
          "en": "this strange app-root element here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.57,
          "end": 33.78,
          "en": "which is not a standard HTML element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.78,
          "end": 35.4,
          "en": "The browser on its own indeed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.4,
          "end": 38.01,
          "en": "would not understand this element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.01,
          "end": 40.77,
          "en": "And that's now where Angular comes in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.77,
          "end": 42.03,
          "en": "Because as I mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.03,
          "end": 44.7,
          "en": "it's actually the code in this main.ts file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.7,
          "end": 48.6,
          "en": "that will be executed when your website loads up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.6,
          "end": 50.1,
          "en": "Now in the index HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.1,
          "end": 54.24,
          "en": "you don't find any imports of that main.ts file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.24,
          "end": 57.33,
          "en": "Indeed, there are no script tags at all in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.33,
          "end": 60.15,
          "en": "But if you visit the loaded website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.15,
          "end": 62.31,
          "en": "and you view its page source,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.31,
          "end": 67.31,
          "en": "you will actually see that in there there are script imports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.38,
          "end": 70.89,
          "en": "and those are injected into this file automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.89,
          "end": 75.89,
          "en": "by the Angular CLI when you build and run your application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.93,
          "end": 77.97,
          "en": "So for example, by running ng serve,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.97,
          "end": 80.7,
          "en": "which we did by running npm start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.7,
          "end": 83.1,
          "en": "So that's how the scripts end up in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.1,
          "end": 86.88,
          "en": "and that's how this code in main.ts gets executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.88,
          "end": 89.28,
          "en": "after being compiled to JavaScript code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.28,
          "end": 91.053,
          "en": "which is also done by the CLI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.28,
          "end": 94.05,
          "en": "That's why in that source code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.05,
          "end": 97.83,
          "en": "we actually find .js files being imported here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.83,
          "end": 101.34,
          "en": "because TypeScript wouldn't run in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.34,
          "end": 104.4,
          "en": "So it's this compiled code that's being executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.4,
          "end": 107.00999999999999,
          "en": "and this code does one important thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.00999999999999,
          "end": 110.55,
          "en": "It executes a function provided by the Angular package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.55,
          "end": 112.83,
          "en": "the bootstrapApplication function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.83,
          "end": 116.82,
          "en": "and this function, in the end, wants an Angular Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.82,
          "end": 118.97999999999999,
          "en": "And as I mentioned in the first section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.97999999999999,
          "end": 121.47,
          "en": "one of the core concepts of Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.47,
          "end": 124.08,
          "en": "is that you will be building Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.08,
          "end": 126.99,
          "en": "So this function wants such a Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.99,
          "end": 129.84,
          "en": "and it in the end then takes this Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.84,
          "end": 134.22,
          "en": "and looks for this Component in that index HTML file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.22,
          "end": 136.77,
          "en": "and tries to replace the tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.77,
          "end": 140.07,
          "en": "the element tag of your custom Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 140.07,
          "end": 144.06,
          "en": "with the markup you defined for your custom Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.06,
          "end": 146.94,
          "en": "Now here in this case, it's actually this AppComponent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.94,
          "end": 149.43,
          "en": "imported from this path here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.43,
          "end": 153.32999999999998,
          "en": "that's being passed to bootstrapApplication.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.32999999999998,
          "end": 157.32,
          "en": "And if we follow that path, we end up in this app folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.32,
          "end": 160.383,
          "en": "and there the app.component.ts file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 161.37,
          "end": 164.04,
          "en": "Now the file extension is actually missing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.04,
          "end": 167.4,
          "en": "because for .ts files, you should omit them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.4,
          "end": 170.55,
          "en": "So instead of importing something from a .ts file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.55,
          "end": 174.18,
          "en": "you import it from just the file name without the extension.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.18,
          "end": 177.42000000000002,
          "en": "But it is this app.component.ts file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.42000000000002,
          "end": 179.73,
          "en": "from which we're importing something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.73,
          "end": 183.9,
          "en": "and we are importing something called AppComponent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.9,
          "end": 186.69,
          "en": "And if we take a look at this app.component.ts file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 186.69,
          "end": 189.48,
          "en": "we see that this is this class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.48,
          "end": 192.72,
          "en": "This class is called AppComponent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 192.72,
          "end": 195.21,
          "en": "So it's that thing we're importing and passing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.21,
          "end": 198.57,
          "en": "to this bootstrapApplication function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.57,
          "end": 202.56,
          "en": "And this class in Angular creates such a Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.56,
          "end": 205.293,
          "en": "such a custom HTML element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.13,
          "end": 210.12,
          "en": "Now it does that because it's not just a class here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 210.12,
          "end": 215.12,
          "en": "Instead, we also have this strange @Component thing above it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.82,
          "end": 217.98,
          "en": "and that's a so-called decorator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217.98,
          "end": 220.56,
          "en": "which is a TypeScript feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.56,
          "end": 223.47,
          "en": "that in the end adds some metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 223.47,
          "end": 225.78,
          "en": "to that thing it's attached to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 225.78,
          "end": 227.91,
          "en": "so to this class here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.91,
          "end": 231.96,
          "en": "And Angular uses decorators, like this Component decorator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231.96,
          "end": 235.2,
          "en": "to add extra metadata to certain things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 235.2,
          "end": 237.06,
          "en": "like to this class here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.06,
          "end": 239.91,
          "en": "And as you can see, this Component decorator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 239.91,
          "end": 243.27,
          "en": "is actually coming from the Angular framework.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 243.27,
          "end": 245.61,
          "en": "We're importing it from the core package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 245.61,
          "end": 248.58,
          "en": "that's part of the Angular framework.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 248.58,
          "end": 250.05,
          "en": "And it's then this decorator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 250.05,
          "end": 252.27,
          "en": "that converts this standard class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 252.27,
          "end": 256.23,
          "en": "into such a Angular Component that's treated as a Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 256.23,
          "end": 260.76,
          "en": "So as a custom HTML element by Angular, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 260.76,
          "end": 262.59,
          "en": "Now this Component thing here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 262.59,
          "end": 266.13,
          "en": "this Component decorator, then receives an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 266.13,
          "end": 268.71,
          "en": "with some configuration for this Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 268.71,
          "end": 271.08,
          "en": "And I'll get back to some of these options later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 271.08,
          "end": 273.54,
          "en": "But one crucial setting you can see here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 273.54,
          "end": 276.27,
          "en": "is this selector property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 276.27,
          "end": 278.61,
          "en": "Because this in the end tells Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 278.61,
          "end": 282.57,
          "en": "for which elements it should look in the HTML code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 282.57,
          "end": 285.6,
          "en": "so that those elements can be replaced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 285.6,
          "end": 289.2,
          "en": "by this Component and its markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 289.2,
          "end": 291.48,
          "en": "And the markup of this Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 291.48,
          "end": 295.68,
          "en": "is stored in the so-called template of that Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 295.68,
          "end": 299.46,
          "en": "And every Angular Component has such a template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 299.46,
          "end": 302.55,
          "en": "which typically is stored in an external file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 302.55,
          "end": 304.41,
          "en": "to which the path is provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 304.41,
          "end": 307.293,
          "en": "with help of this templateUrl property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 308.4,
          "end": 310.98,
          "en": "So here it's this app.component.html file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 310.98,
          "end": 314.04,
          "en": "that contains the markup for this Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 314.04,
          "end": 317.16,
          "en": "for this custom HTML element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 317.16,
          "end": 319.77,
          "en": "So now because of this selector, we know that we're looking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 319.77,
          "end": 322.2,
          "en": "for an element called app-root,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 322.2,
          "end": 324.93,
          "en": "so with a tag of app-root,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 324.93,
          "end": 326.7,
          "en": "and that it's this markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 326.7,
          "end": 328.743,
          "en": "that should be rendered in its place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 329.58,
          "end": 331.74,
          "en": "We also have some styles set up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 331.74,
          "end": 334.65,
          "en": "also stored in an external file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 334.65,
          "end": 337.14,
          "en": "And these will be styles that only apply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 337.14,
          "end": 339,
          "en": "to the markup of this Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 339,
          "end": 341.61,
          "en": "So they can't clash with any other styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 341.61,
          "end": 344.61,
          "en": "of other Components, which is pretty convenient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 344.61,
          "end": 348.15,
          "en": "And we got some other settings which we can ignore for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 348.15,
          "end": 349.74,
          "en": "But it's because of this setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 349.74,
          "end": 352.5,
          "en": "and because of this selector here most importantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 352.5,
          "end": 356.4,
          "en": "that this app-root element in the index HTML file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 356.4,
          "end": 359.04,
          "en": "is replaced by the markup stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 359.04,
          "end": 362.1,
          "en": "in this app.component.html file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 362.1,
          "end": 366.93,
          "en": "And that is this title, this sub-title, and this image here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 366.93,
          "end": 370.14,
          "en": "And that indeed is what we're seeing on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 370.14,
          "end": 372.96,
          "en": "And that's how Angular is taking over",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 372.96,
          "end": 376.773,
          "en": "and how such a Angular Component ends up on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
